{"id":"n-20261006-j4ajvk","category":"gaming","display_title":"Warhammer Survivors November Release","display_title_he":"ההשקה של וורהאמר סוריוורס בנובמבר","short_summary":"Warhammer Survivors, a new bullet heaven roguelike created in partnership with Poncle, is set to launch on November 10, 2026.","english_level":"C1","words":419,"reading_time":3,"image":null,"sources":[{"name":"Polygon","domain":"polygon.com","url":"https://www.polygon.com/warhammer-survivors-release-date-announced","title":"New Warhammer Meets Vampire Survivors Game Sets November Release","published_at":"2026-10-06T15:34:09.000Z"},{"name":"IGN","domain":"ign.com","url":"https://www.ign.com/articles/warhammer-survivors-release-date-revealed-alongside-a-new-demo-you-can-play-right-now","title":"Warhammer Survivors Release Date Revealed Alongside a New Demo You Can Play Right Now","published_at":"2026-10-06T14:00:07.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-06T14:00:07.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-06T16:16:40.371Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["The gaming landscape for November is growing notably crowded, packed with massive titles. Despite this busy period, developer and publisher Auroch Digital officially revealed that Warhammer Survivors is launching on November 10, 2026. This fresh project belongs to the roguelike bullet heaven genre, often referred to as a survivorslike, which was popularized by Vampire Survivors. In an exciting collaboration, Poncle, the brilliant mind behind Vampire Survivors, has teamed up with Warhammer to lend its extensive expertise to this upcoming title.","Set across two distinct campaigns, the frantic action transports players into the grimdark 41st Millennium of Warhammer 40,000 alongside the Mortal Realms of Warhammer Age of Sigmar. Participants can unlock more than 40 diverse characters sourced directly from both expansive universes. Each character offers a completely unique playstyle driven by individual statistics and specialized weaponry. In total, the experience boasts over 75 weapons spread across more than 15 stages.","The arsenal features iconic armaments that fans of the franchise will immediately recognize, including Malum Caedo's Chainsword and Neave Blacktalon's Tempest Axes. Furthermore, the developers incorporated creative weapons directly inspired by the classic tabletop hobby experience. Players can splatter enemies with Nuln Oil to make them far more vulnerable to subsequent fire damage, or toss D6 Dice across the battlefield that erupt in explosions if they land on the correct numerical value. These imaginative mechanics culminate brilliantly on a dedicated Hobby Table stage, which is further complemented by an integrated paint pot system.","Eager fans do not have to wait until November to sample the action, as a brand-new playable demo is available right now on PC through Steam and Xbox. This updated demo introduces Lyssa Ravenya and The Legend of Catachan, while incorporating essential improvements derived straight from previous community feedback. As players progress through the stages, they must confront terrifying Extremis Bosses—such as the formidable Norn Emissary—which are intentionally crafted to present an extreme challenge even for seasoned veterans of the genre.","Warhammer Survivors will retail for $7.99, £6.39, or €7.49, accompanied by a special 10% discount for preorders and early launch windows on selected platforms. Better yet, members subscribed to Xbox Game Pass gain access to the title at absolutely no additional cost on day one. When the full version arrives, it will land on a massive array of hardware platforms, including Android, iOS, Nintendo Switch, Nintendo Switch 2, PlayStation 5, Windows PC, and Xbox Series X and S. Meanwhile, other Warhammer fans can also look forward to the real-time strategy game Warhammer 40,000: Dawn of War 4, which is scheduled to drop in December following a minor delay."],"facts":[{"fact":"Auroch Digital announced that Warhammer Survivors will be released on November 10, 2026.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"The game is a roguelike bullet heaven developed in partnership with Vampire Survivors creator Poncle.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"It features over 40 playable characters from Warhammer 40,000 and Warhammer Age of Sigmar universes.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"The game will retail for $7.99 and will be available on multiple platforms including day one on Xbox Game Pass.","sources":[1,2]},{"fact":"A playable demo is currently available on PC via Steam and Xbox.","sources":[2]}],"glossary":[{"text":"gaming","lemma":"gaming","pos":"noun","he":"משחקים","name":false},{"text":"landscape","lemma":"landscape","pos":"noun","he":"נוף","name":false},{"text":"November","lemma":"November","pos":"proper noun","he":"נובמבר","name":true},{"text":"growing","lemma":"grow","pos":"verb","he":"גדל","name":false},{"text":"notably","lemma":"notably","pos":"adverb","he":"במיוחד","name":false},{"text":"crowded","lemma":"crowded","pos":"adjective","he":"עמוס","name":false},{"text":"packed","lemma":"pack","pos":"verb","he":"דחוס","name":false},{"text":"massive","lemma":"massive","pos":"adjective","he":"עצום","name":false},{"text":"titles","lemma":"title","pos":"noun","he":"כותרים","name":false},{"text":"Despite","lemma":"despite","pos":"preposition","he":"למרות","name":false},{"text":"busy","lemma":"busy","pos":"adjective","he":"עסוק","name":false},{"text":"period","lemma":"period","pos":"noun","he":"תקופה","name":false},{"text":"developer","lemma":"developer","pos":"noun","he":"מפתח","name":false},{"text":"publisher","lemma":"publisher","pos":"noun","he":"מוציא לאור","name":false},{"text":"Auroch Digital","lemma":"Auroch Digital","pos":"proper noun","he":"אורוק דיגיטל","name":true},{"text":"officially","lemma":"officially","pos":"adverb","he":"רשמית","name":false},{"text":"revealed","lemma":"reveal","pos":"verb","he":"חשף","name":false},{"text":"Warhammer Survivo